direction: down

attach: attachProfiler() starts
host: Has modelContext appeared? {
  shape: diamond
}
poll: Check document, navigator and window every 250 ms
patch: Patch registerTool and provideContext
timing: Was the profiler attached before registration? {
  shape: diamond
}
automatic: Every newly registered tool is wrapped automatically
retrofit: Call instrument(siteToolMap) for already registered tools
invoke: Any caller invokes the same wrapped execute function
detach: detach() restores tools, host methods and observers

attach -> host
host -> patch: Yes
host -> poll: Not yet
poll -> host: Keep watching
patch -> timing
timing -> automatic: Yes
timing -> retrofit: No
automatic -> invoke
retrofit -> invoke
invoke -> detach: When profiling ends

*.style.border-radius: 14
attach.style.fill: "#dbeafe"
attach.style.stroke: "#2563eb"
host.style.fill: "#fef3c7"
host.style.stroke: "#d97706"
poll.style.fill: "#f5f5f4"
poll.style.stroke: "#78716c"
patch.style.fill: "#ede9fe"
patch.style.stroke: "#7c3aed"
timing.style.fill: "#fef3c7"
timing.style.stroke: "#d97706"
automatic.style.fill: "#d1fae5"
automatic.style.stroke: "#059669"
retrofit.style.fill: "#ffedd5"
retrofit.style.stroke: "#ea580c"
invoke.style.fill: "#e0f2fe"
invoke.style.stroke: "#0284c7"
detach.style.fill: "#f5f5f4"
detach.style.stroke: "#78716c"
